ypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|L\\|\">\\(\\|L\\|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}\">\\(\\operatorname{card}\\)</span> 为集合基数。工作元理论为 ZFC。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{card}(\\mathrm{Form}_L)=\\|L\\|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{card}(\\mathrm{Form}_L)=\\|L\\|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 1.3.4，印刷 p.24，原文明确给出基数结论。上界：每个公式是大小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|L\\|\">\\(\\|L\\|\\)</span> 的字母表上的有限字符串。下界：变量等式提供可数个不同公式；每个关系符号可放入原子公式，每个函数符号可放入项的自等式，每个常元可放入常元自等式。带标签语法保证这些注入不混同，因此取得整个非逻辑符号集的基数下界。此处补足本地证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved",